[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   interleavings of the low-level and the wrapper entry point, not just each one
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   alone.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **observable-output axis:** `static_sum` yields a return value; `driver`
