[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - input shape axis for the single `int` parameter: sign (`0`, `+`, `-`),
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   magnitude (small / large / extremal `INT_MIN`, `INT_MAX`), and whether it
