[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `driver`: capture the C stdout bytes and the Rust stdout bytes for the same
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `stride` and assert they are byte-identical.
