[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Randomized rows use a fixed-seed SplitMix64 PRNG (seed noted per row) and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m many inputs per row, per Phase B.
