[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    141[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `#[no_mangle]` removed from `driver` (export wrapper gone) | yes | 43 |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    142[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    143[0m:[38;5;10m[49m So the suite is sensitive to arithmetic, wrapping behaviour, output formatting,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    144[0m:[38;5;10m[49m loop bounds, static initialisation, single-value special cases, and the presence
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    145[0m:[38;5;10m[49m of the `#[no_mangle]` export wrappers themselves.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    146[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    147[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## C-compiler-variance cross-check
