[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    151[0m:[38;5;10m[49m full suite was re-run against C shared libraries built at `-O0`, `-O1`, `-O2`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    152[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `-O3`, `-Os`, `-Ofast` and `-O2 -fno-strict-overflow` (via `STATICLOOP_C_SO`).
